<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<definitions xmlns="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="defs_to_be_05_rekap" targetNamespace="http://cbt-smk-v2/bpmn/to-be" exporter="CBT SMK v2 Tim To-Be BPMN" exporterVersion="1.0">
  <process id="to_be_05_rekap" name="To-Be 05 Rekap dan Berita Acara" isExecutable="false">
    <documentation>To-Be 05 — Rekap dan Berita Acara DENGAN aplikasi CBT SMK v2.

Alur: Guru memilih kelas dan paket; sistem menghitung rekap otomatis
per kelas/paket (nilai objektif, nilai manual/esai, nilai akhir, status
hadir, pelanggaran, waktu). Sistem membandingkan tiap nilai akhir dengan
KKTP per mapel/TP lalu menampilkan agregat: rata-rata (dengan N pembagi
eksplisit), median, tertinggi/terendah, jumlah + persentase lulus, dan
status LULUS / TIDAK LULUS / BELUM DINILAI / TIDAK HADIR. Bila perlu,
rekap diexport ke CSV (UTF-8, header Indonesia). Proktor menyusun berita
acara per jadwal + sesi + ruangan (hadir/tidak hadir, kejadian, pelanggaran,
kendala teknis) dan sistem mencetaknya dalam format print-friendly
(kop, nomor dokumen, tanggal cetak, tanda tangan).

Asumsi: (1) Nilai sementara berlabel SEMENTARA; nilai final dikunci
menjadi ledger. (2) Rekap hanya menghitung attempt yang sudah submit;
esai belum dikoreksi = belum dinilai, bukan 0. (3) Berita acara dibuat
per jadwal + sesi + ruangan. (4) Privasi: proktor melihat status
pelaksanaan + agregat; guru hanya mapelnya; siswa hanya nilainya sendiri.

Fakta aplikasi yang dipakai: rekap + export CSV + berita acara
(KONTRAK §8.5); KKTP per mapel/TP, bukan hardcode KKM=75 (KONTRAK §8.6);
aturan rekap + agregat + berita acara (ANALISIS Bab 8.1, 8.3).</documentation>
    <laneSet id="laneset_to_be_05_rekap">
      <lane id="lane_0" name="Guru">
        <flowNodeRef>start</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_pilih</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>g_export</flowNodeRef>
      </lane>
      <lane id="lane_1" name="Proktor">
        <flowNodeRef>g_ba</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_susun</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>end</flowNodeRef>
      </lane>
      <lane id="lane_2" name="Sistem (CBT SMK v2)">
        <flowNodeRef>t_hitung</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_kktp</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_tampil</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_export</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_cetak</flowNodeRef>
      </lane>
    </laneSet>
    <startEvent id="start" name="Mulai">
      <outgoing>f01</outgoing>
    </startEvent>
    <userTask id="t_pilih" name="Pilih Kelas dan Paket">
      <incoming>f01</incoming>
      <outgoing>f02</outgoing>
    </userTask>
    <serviceTask id="t_hitung" name="Hitung Rekap Otomatis">
      <incoming>f02</incoming>
      <outgoing>f03</outgoing>
    </serviceTask>
    <serviceTask id="t_kktp" name="Bandingkan Nilai dengan KKTP per Mapel">
      <incoming>f03</incoming>
      <outgoing>f04</outgoing>
    </serviceTask>
    <serviceTask id="t_tampil" name="Tampilkan Rata-rata dan Status Lulus">
      <incoming>f04</incoming>
      <outgoing>f05</outgoing>
    </serviceTask>
    <exclusiveGateway id="g_export" name="Perlu Export CSV?">
      <incoming>f05</incoming>
      <outgoing>f06</outgoing>
      <outgoing>f08</outgoing>
    </exclusiveGateway>
    <serviceTask id="t_export" name="Export Rekap ke CSV">
      <incoming>f06</incoming>
      <outgoing>f07</outgoing>
    </serviceTask>
    <exclusiveGateway id="g_ba" name="Perlu Berita Acara?">
      <incoming>f07</incoming>
      <incoming>f08</incoming>
      <outgoing>f09</outgoing>
      <outgoing>f12</outgoing>
    </exclusiveGateway>
    <userTask id="t_susun" name="Susun Berita Acara">
      <incoming>f09</incoming>
      <outgoing>f10</outgoing>
    </userTask>
    <serviceTask id="t_cetak" name="Cetak Berita Acara Print-Friendly">
      <incoming>f10</incoming>
      <outgoing>f11</outgoing>
    </serviceTask>
    <endEvent id="end" name="Selesai: Laporan Terbit">
      <incoming>f11</incoming>
      <incoming>f12</incoming>
    </endEvent>
    <sequenceFlow id="f01" sourceRef="start" targetRef="t_pilih" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f02" sourceRef="t_pilih" targetRef="t_hitung" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f03" sourceRef="t_hitung" targetRef="t_kktp" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f04" sourceRef="t_kktp" targetRef="t_tampil" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f05" sourceRef="t_tampil" targetRef="g_export" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f06" sourceRef="g_export" targetRef="t_export" name="Ya" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f07" sourceRef="t_export" targetRef="g_ba" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f08" sourceRef="g_export" targetRef="g_ba" name="Tidak" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f09" sourceRef="g_ba" targetRef="t_susun" name="Ya" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f10" sourceRef="t_susun" targetRef="t_cetak" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f11" sourceRef="t_cetak" targetRef="end" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f12" sourceRef="g_ba" targetRef="end" name="Tidak" />
  </process>
